WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:08,100
Song Jingyi’s matchmaker in the orphanage

2
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,660
You are not allowed to bully Jin Yi

3
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:11,060
In order to protect Song Jingyi

4
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:14,500
He worked his way up to become a legal advisor to Fortune 500 companies in the upper class.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,940
The cost of a lawsuit can reach millions

6
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:18,700
May I ask which ward Song Jingyi is in?

7
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:19,940
in the second ward

8
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:22,500
Auditor has always treated Song Jingyi as his property

9
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,940
There's another good show

10
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,930
I have actually been preparing this gift for a long time

11
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:28,290
I never knew how to give it to you

12
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:29,490
this is too expensive

13
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:31,130
Why did you suddenly give me this?

14
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:33,250
Because actually the person I like

15
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:35,090
Aji, why are you here?

16
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:36,410
Miko said you were hurt.

17
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:37,490
Why didn't you tell me

18
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:39,490
It's just a sprain. You're so busy at work.

19
00:00:39,490 --> 00:00:40,450
No need to come all the way

20
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:42,620
I always put your affairs first

21
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:43,580
How to live here

22
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:46,460
I'll transfer you to the VIP ward so you can have some peace and quiet. There's no need.

23
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:48,020
Just take a break here temporarily

24
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:50,140
You can leave the hospital and go back to school in the evening

25
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:52,100
As long as you don't feel uncomfortable carrying it, that's fine

26
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,790
This is

27
00:00:53,790 --> 00:00:55,790
Song Jingyi has no shortage of suitors around her

28
00:00:55,790 --> 00:00:58,110
Handsome, in good shape, rich

29
00:00:58,110 --> 00:01:00,230
Can help him academically

30
00:01:00,230 --> 00:01:03,840
What makes you think you can impress me easily?

31
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,040
He is Keke's boyfriend

32
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:07,520
Sorry for scaring people.

33
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:10,280
I thought he was some kind of suitor of yours

34
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:11,620
That's it

35
00:01:11,620 --> 00:01:13,380
Because I like Miko

36
00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:15,500
So I also want to thank Jingyi for being a good best friend.

37
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:17,540
Take care of her for me when I'm not around

38
00:01:17,540 --> 00:01:19,900
This is just a thank you gift

39
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:21,420
you are too polite

40
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:22,940
Miko is my good friend

41
00:01:22,940 --> 00:01:25,100
Of course I have to be nice to her

42
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:26,540
But thank you

43
00:01:26,540 --> 00:01:30,540
I love talking about this gift

44
00:01:30,540 --> 00:01:33,580
Why isn't Miko here?

45
00:01:33,580 --> 00:01:35,700
Because my sprain is a bit purple

46
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:37,940
So Jiang Mu also took me down the mountain first.

47
00:01:37,940 --> 00:01:40,820
Keke slowly brought our luggage down from the mountain for us.

48
00:01:40,820 --> 00:01:42,610
That's it

49
00:01:42,610 --> 00:01:45,370
You are so nice to Miko's friends

50
00:01:45,370 --> 00:01:46,970
You shouldn't be worried either

51
00:01:46,970 --> 00:01:50,130
My girlfriend is alone in the mountains, right?

52
00:01:50,130 --> 00:01:51,130
Then I'll leave first
